                                  ┌────────────────────────── Before we start ───────────────────────────┐                                  
                                  │telegram-tui can send anonymous usage telemetry to help find bugs and │                                  
                                  │see which features get used.                                          │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │Collected: app/OS version, terminal type, action names (e.g. "sent a  │                                  
                                  │message"), outcomes, error kinds, durations, and a random per-install │                                  
                                  │id.                                                                   │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │Never collected: message text, contact names, phone numbers, chat     │                                  
                                  │titles, or file names.                                                │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │Sent to: the telegram-tui project's telemetry endpoint.               │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │Change your mind later: `--no-telemetry`,                             │                                  
                                  │`TELEGRAM_TUI_TELEMETRY=off`, `DO_NOT_TRACK=1`, or edit config.toml.  │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │               Enable                           ▶ Disable             │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │↑↓←→/tab choose · ⏎ confirm                                           │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  │                                                                      │                                  
                                  └──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
